window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>He's determined to break her. </p> <p>For Lucas Kent, his new prisoner is a maddening contradiction: compliant yet defiant, fragile yet strong. He needs to uncover her secrets, but doing so may ruin everything. </p> <p>His obsession could destroy her. </p> <p>She's determined to escape. </p> <p>For Yulia Tzakova, her captor is the man of both her dreams and her nightmares: tender one moment, cruel the next. She can't let him crack her, but resisting him may leave her broken. </p> <p>A moment of weakness could cost her everything. </p>"; 
